; A harmless copy of the boss, instanced by RainbowChapterBossBehaviour.CastAfterimages. Replaces the
; template GameplayEnemySpawner.CreateAfterimagePrefab parented to the boss and Duplicate()d.
;
; One node, no texture: BossAfterimage IS the Sprite2D, and Configure() hands it the boss's own
; texture, colour, body size and sorting order at the moment it is cast. There is nothing to author.
[gd_scene load_steps=2 format=3]

